(2660577, 367549, 62027, '<td valign="top">great capture of expressions :)... amazing how black and white these babies are!<br/> <br/>even if the image were not black and white, it would still be great to show the contrast of skin tones with the white the children are wearing, as well as the background.</td>', 'great capture of expressions :)... amazing how black and white these babies are! even if the image were not black and white, it would still be great to show the contrast of skin tones with the white the children are wearing, as well as the background.', '2006-07-26 01:51:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2660585, 369546, 49625, '<td valign="top">Maby a tighter crop around the area of focus?</td>', 'Maby a tighter crop around the area of focus?', '2006-07-26 01:52:06.000000', NULL, 1),
