(2660641, 369308, 2170, '<td valign="top">would be better without the glare spots.  good angle, though.</td>', 'would be better without the glare spots.  good angle, though.', '2006-07-26 01:57:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2660649, 369742, 17272, '<td valign="top">Out of focus... I can''t even tell what that thing is! 1</td>', 'Out of focus... I can''t even tell what that thing is! 1', '2006-07-26 01:58:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2660671, 369078, 62575, '<td valign="top">I like the feel of stillness and motion; of waiting at the end of the day; of water above and water below.</td>', 'I like the feel of stillness and motion; of waiting at the end of the day; of water above and water below.', '2006-07-26 02:02:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2660672, 369337, 17272, '<td valign="top">Great image! My favorite so far.</td>', 'Great image! My favorite so far.', '2006-07-26 02:02:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2660674, 369885, 17272, '<td valign="top">Cute face.</td>', 'Cute face.', '2006-07-26 02:03:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2660684, 368488, 62575, '<td valign="top">Nice use of black and white in color.  Like the textures.</td>', 'Nice use of black and white in color.  Like the textures.', '2006-07-26 02:04:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2660692, 369773, 2170, '<td valign="top">i see you!</td>', 'i see you!', '2006-07-26 02:05:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2660694, 369713, 62575, '<td valign="top">Nice closeup of complexity.  Wish more of the image were in focus, though it is nice to have a bit of blur in the back to get depth.</td>', 'Nice closeup of complexity.  Wish more of the image were in focus, though it is nice to have a bit of blur in the back to get depth.', '2006-07-26 02:05:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2660703, 367209, 2170, '<td valign="top">it was an advanced editing challenge.  you could have cloned out some dust spots.</td>', 'it was an advanced editing challenge.  you could have cloned out some dust spots.', '2006-07-26 02:06:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2660705, 369821, 62575, '<td valign="top">I love the humor here; there is a sense of play, of conversation, of him and her.  Pity the white background in the upper right has visible gradation lines.  Still, this one just makes me smile, so it''s my favorite.</td>', 'I love the humor here; there is a sense of play, of conversation, of him and her.  Pity the white background in the upper right has visible gradation lines.  Still, this one just makes me smile, so it''s my favorite.', '2006-07-26 02:07:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2660715, 368372, 62575, '<td valign="top">I''m always a sucker for these lines of misty hills.  Pity there''s not one spot of bright color from something.</td>', 'I''m always a sucker for these lines of misty hills.  Pity there''s not one spot of bright color from something.', '2006-07-26 02:09:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2660718, 369856, 61705, '<td valign="top">I rarely vote, and even more rarely comment on cat photos, but I had to stop and congratulate you on this one. Yes, it''s dark (some may even complain that it''s too dark), but that, to me, is what makes this image so outstanding. The one highlighted whisker cuts the negative space gracefully and is the icing on the cake for this masterful piece of photography. Simply put - 10.</td>', 'I rarely vote, and even more rarely comment on cat photos, but I had to stop and congratulate you on this one. Yes, it''s dark (some may even complain that it''s too dark), but that, to me, is what makes this image so outstanding. The one highlighted whisker cuts the negative space gracefully and is the icing on the cake for this masterful piece of photography. Simply put - 10.', '2006-07-26 02:09:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2660726, 369428, 62575, '<td valign="top">Nice simple black and white.  Lovely difference in texture between the crisp leave and it''s softer reflection.</td>', 'Nice simple black and white.  Lovely difference in texture between the crisp leave and it''s softer reflection.', '2006-07-26 02:10:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2660732, 367445, 43191, '<td valign="top">Nice hand and nice shot.</td>', 'Nice hand and nice shot.', '2006-07-26 02:11:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2660738, 369838, 62575, '<td valign="top">I like the motion and curve.  Wish the line of blowing seeds reached into the stem so that some were just beginning to leave; without this the break between the seeds still on and the seeds flying away seems ... odd.</td>', 'I like the motion and curve.  Wish the line of blowing seeds reached into the stem so that some were just beginning to leave; without this the break between the seeds still on and the seeds flying away seems ... odd.', '2006-07-26 02:12:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2660739, 369301, 62009, '<td valign="top">At least it''s not just me that does this</td>', 'At least it''s not just me that does this', '2006-07-26 02:12:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2660752, 369856, 62575, '<td valign="top">Took me a moment to figure out what this is, and then smiled at the prominence of a single whisker.  Somehow find this image quite pleasing; it keeps pulling my eye back.</td>', 'Took me a moment to figure out what this is, and then smiled at the prominence of a single whisker.  Somehow find this image quite pleasing; it keeps pulling my eye back.', '2006-07-26 02:13:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2660762, 369649, 62575, '<td valign="top">Yup, a perfect day for a black and white in color.  Like the constrast between the crispness of the sculpture and the fuzzy clouds.  Intriguing....</td>', 'Yup, a perfect day for a black and white in color.  Like the constrast between the crispness of the sculpture and the fuzzy clouds.  Intriguing....', '2006-07-26 02:14:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2660775, 369240, 61413, '<td valign="top">Nicely framed, and interesting textures on the statue. But I would have chosen a different angle, I think. and maybe taken a different tack with lighting to get some more contrast. I do like the black background, though.</td>', 'Nicely framed, and interesting textures on the statue. But I would have chosen a different angle, I think. and maybe taken a different tack with lighting to get some more contrast. I do like the black background, though.', '2006-07-26 02:18:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2660782, 369862, 24495, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and subject. But DNMC IMHO. 7.</td>', 'Nice composition and subject. But DNMC IMHO. 7.', '2006-07-26 02:19:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2660789, 368267, 61413, '<td valign="top">I think the subject of the photo has a lot of potential, although I''ve a sneaking feeling I''ll be looking at a lot more chess pieces before I''ve finished judging this challenge.<br/> <br/>The texture on the pieces is quite absorbing, but I think it could''ve been framed better. Maybe you could have featured the white pieces more strongly, to come up with a more interesting composition.</td>', 'I think the subject of the photo has a lot of potential, although I''ve a sneaking feeling I''ll be looking at a lot more chess pieces before I''ve finished judging this challenge. The texture on the pieces is quite absorbing, but I think it could''ve been framed better. Maybe you could have featured the white pieces more strongly, to come up with a more interesting composition.', '2006-07-26 02:21:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2660797, 367879, 61413, '<td valign="top">A nicely composed shot. My initial reaction would have been to include more of the car at the bottom, but I think you''ve made the right choice here.<br/> <br/>The rear-view mirror looks a little oddly conspicuous. I would have experimented with slightly more of a downward looking composition; but that may well have lost the overall flow of the lines of the car.</td>', 'A nicely composed shot. My initial reaction would have been to include more of the car at the bottom, but I think you''ve made the right choice here. The rear-view mirror looks a little oddly conspicuous. I would have experimented with slightly more of a downward looking composition; but that may well have lost the overall flow of the lines of the car.', '2006-07-26 02:24:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2660807, 368225, 61413, '<td valign="top">Nice textures in the glass.<br/> <br/>I wonder, though, whether the choice to silhouette the cat was deliberate, or to make the most of a poor exposure of the cat''s features.<br/> <br/>Nicely framed and composed, though.</td>', 'Nice textures in the glass. I wonder, though, whether the choice to silhouette the cat was deliberate, or to make the most of a poor exposure of the cat''s features. Nicely framed and composed, though.', '2006-07-26 02:25:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2660812, 367412, 61413, '<td valign="top">More grey than strikingly black 7 white. This doesn''t really "speak" to me, if that''s not too pretentious. There are lots of interesting angles, light &amp; shadow, detail, etc. But you haven''t really made much of it, I''m afraid.</td>', 'More grey than strikingly black 7 white. This doesn''t really "speak" to me, if that''s not too pretentious. There are lots of interesting angles, light & shadow, detail, etc. But you haven''t really made much of it, I''m afraid.', '2006-07-26 02:28:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2660839, 369682, 61413, '<td valign="top">a nice idea, but I would hav focussed differently. The feathers draw the eye up towards the head. I would have focussed on the head, with just sufficiently narrow depth of field to allow the foreground feathers to start to go OOF.</td>', 'a nice idea, but I would hav focussed differently. The feathers draw the eye up towards the head. I would have focussed on the head, with just sufficiently narrow depth of field to allow the foreground feathers to start to go OOF.', '2006-07-26 02:35:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2660850, 368234, 61413, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. Angling the glass is a neat touch. It''s a shame that the shutter speed required for a shot like this forces some of the droplets out of focus, but I''m not sure what you can do about that.</td>', 'Nicely done. Angling the glass is a neat touch. It''s a shame that the shutter speed required for a shot like this forces some of the droplets out of focus, but I''m not sure what you can do about that.', '2006-07-26 02:37:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2660854, 367981, 61413, '<td valign="top">There were a gazillion shots like this in a challenge a couple of weeks ago. This one is competently done, but a bit "me too".</td>', 'There were a gazillion shots like this in a challenge a couple of weeks ago. This one is competently done, but a bit "me too".', '2006-07-26 02:39:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2660863, 366456, 61413, '<td valign="top">This is competently done - well composed, etc. But the juxtaposition of the sheet music with the foliage just doesn''t grab me, I''m afraid.</td>', 'This is competently done - well composed, etc. But the juxtaposition of the sheet music with the foliage just doesn''t grab me, I''m afraid.', '2006-07-26 02:40:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2660870, 368338, 61413, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. A spectacularly clean bit of locomotive. Maybe just a slightly narrower depth of field, with the right hand drifting a little OOF, might have added to the effect.</td>', 'Nice shot. A spectacularly clean bit of locomotive. Maybe just a slightly narrower depth of field, with the right hand drifting a little OOF, might have added to the effect.', '2006-07-26 02:42:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2660888, 369228, 61413, '<td valign="top">Yep, it''s a hamburger stand, alright.<br/> <br/>Of itself, it''s a good shot, though not everyone will like the dominance of the shadows. I like the yellow of the incandescent lights, and the moody silhouette of the people. But it doesn''t really say "black and white" to me. It''s got lots of black and white, so it''s hard to say DNMC, but...</td>', 'Yep, it''s a hamburger stand, alright. Of itself, it''s a good shot, though not everyone will like the dominance of the shadows. I like the yellow of the incandescent lights, and the moody silhouette of the people. But it doesn''t really say "black and white" to me. It''s got lots of black and white, so it''s hard to say DNMC, but...', '2006-07-26 02:46:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2660898, 368580, 61413, '<td valign="top">I tried a similar concept to this for this challenge. It''s hard to make it work, eh?<br/> <br/>This comes close, but the fingers don''t look like they''re playing the keys, and the framing of the hand is off.</td>', 'I tried a similar concept to this for this challenge. It''s hard to make it work, eh? This comes close, but the fingers don''t look like they''re playing the keys, and the framing of the hand is off.', '2006-07-26 02:49:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2660903, 369332, 15358, '<td valign="top">made me smile with your title,  very creative</td>', 'made me smile with your title,  very creative', '2006-07-26 02:50:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2660906, 369333, 61413, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done.<br/> <br/>It''s a shame that the stem of the glass on the right is a bit washed out. and the black/white background looks just a tad too much like it''s completely a product of photoshop. But that''s just nitpicking - overall it works well.</td>', 'Very nicely done. It''s a shame that the stem of the glass on the right is a bit washed out. and the black/white background looks just a tad too much like it''s completely a product of photoshop. But that''s just nitpicking - overall it works well.', '2006-07-26 02:51:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2660910, 369797, 61413, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait shot. I love the detailed texture of the body-paint. and the model''s face has just the right "black and white" mood, too.</td>', 'Nice portrait shot. I love the detailed texture of the body-paint. and the model''s face has just the right "black and white" mood, too.', '2006-07-26 02:53:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2660922, 369079, 34938, '<td valign="top">the first one in 20 shots that actually seems to meet the challenge...:=(</td>', 'the first one in 20 shots that actually seems to meet the challenge...:=(', '2006-07-26 02:55:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2660930, 369301, 61705, '<td valign="top">I was so going to do the coffee and cigarette thing myself. I''m glad I didn''t though, would have come up against this. One of the best entries I''ve seen so far. Well executed, 10 and favourite.</td>', 'I was so going to do the coffee and cigarette thing myself. I''m glad I didn''t though, would have come up against this. One of the best entries I''ve seen so far. Well executed, 10 and favourite.', '2006-07-26 02:57:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2660932, 369821, 61413, '<td valign="top">There will be plenty of chess pieces in this challenge, I''m sure. but this is nicely done.<br/> <br/>The perspective of the chess-board is well executed, with a narrow depth of field to make the board blur towards us. The reflections of the pieces works well, too.<br/> <br/>I might''ve tried cropping some off the top, and maybe reframing to make for one-third/two-third split of back vs white, rather than three-quarters/one quarter. Nitpicking, though - overall it works well.</td>', 'There will be plenty of chess pieces in this challenge, I''m sure. but this is nicely done. The perspective of the chess-board is well executed, with a narrow depth of field to make the board blur towards us. The reflections of the pieces works well, too. I might''ve tried cropping some off the top, and maybe reframing to make for one-third/two-third split of back vs white, rather than three-quarters/one quarter. Nitpicking, though - overall it works well.', '2006-07-26 02:57:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2660938, 368372, 34938, '<td valign="top">superb shot...a magic place</td>', 'superb shot...a magic place', '2006-07-26 02:58:25.000000', NULL, 1),
