(2661035, 367830, 61413, '<td valign="top">Nice.<br/> <br/>I would have experimented with making the blacks a little blacker, and maybe altering the angle of the brolly to bring it closer to the bottom left corner. and maybe going quater-face with the lion.<br/> <br/>But overall, it works well.</td>', 'Nice. I would have experimented with making the blacks a little blacker, and maybe altering the angle of the brolly to bring it closer to the bottom left corner. and maybe going quater-face with the lion. But overall, it works well.', '2006-07-26 03:08:52.000000', NULL, 1),
