(2661147, 369320, 61413, '<td valign="top">This is a great topic for this challenge subject, and the strong lighting works well. But I think you could have done a litle more with it.<br/> <br/> <br/>It''s a shame that the paw is clipped off over on the right. Maybe a lower angle, showing more of the cat''s facial features, would have worked better. And maybe on a more reflective surface.</td>', 'This is a great topic for this challenge subject, and the strong lighting works well. But I think you could have done a litle more with it.  It''s a shame that the paw is clipped off over on the right. Maybe a lower angle, showing more of the cat''s facial features, would have worked better. And maybe on a more reflective surface.', '2006-07-26 03:19:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2661166, 369744, 34938, '<td valign="top">should ribbon...all the other shots were pathetic...this is clearly the best for this challenge...good luck 10</td>', 'should ribbon...all the other shots were pathetic...this is clearly the best for this challenge...good luck 10', '2006-07-26 03:21:53.000000', NULL, 1),
