(2661188, 369649, 61413, '<td valign="top">This is a nice shot. But, given that the main feaute is a sculpture, it seems to be trading strongly on someone else''s artwork. A nicely composed shot, though - moody sky.</td>', 'This is a nice shot. But, given that the main feaute is a sculpture, it seems to be trading strongly on someone else''s artwork. A nicely composed shot, though - moody sky.', '2006-07-26 03:24:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2661189, 368234, 34938, '<td valign="top">superb...one of the better ones in this challenge 9</td>', 'superb...one of the better ones in this challenge 9', '2006-07-26 03:24:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2661324, 369473, 61413, '<td valign="top">This must''ve been a very tricky shot to take. You need that fast shutter speed; but you really <i>don''t</i> need that narrow depth of field.<br/> <br/>The blur on the right-hand die actually creates a nice sense of motion, though I think it''s focus blur rather than speed blur. But a nice effect, nonetheless.</td>', 'This must''ve been a very tricky shot to take. You need that fast shutter speed; but you really don''t need that narrow depth of field. The blur on the right-hand die actually creates a nice sense of motion, though I think it''s focus blur rather than speed blur. But a nice effect, nonetheless.', '2006-07-26 03:36:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2661336, 369831, 61413, '<td valign="top">Very nice. A good original idea, well executed.</td>', 'Very nice. A good original idea, well executed.', '2006-07-26 03:37:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2661346, 367098, 61413, '<td valign="top">There''s a good idea lurking in here. But you need a more interesting angle on the cup &amp; pot, and to focus on the pot rather than the checkered background.</td>', 'There''s a good idea lurking in here. But you need a more interesting angle on the cup & pot, and to focus on the pot rather than the checkered background.', '2006-07-26 03:41:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2661353, 369810, 61413, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.</td>', 'Beautiful.', '2006-07-26 03:43:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2661366, 367996, 61413, '<td valign="top">Well executed. Effective use of lighting.</td>', 'Well executed. Effective use of lighting.', '2006-07-26 03:47:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2661394, 369675, 61413, '<td valign="top">A good idea, nicely executed. i might''ve tried to capture at least a little of the milk hitting the side of the glass - but what you have works well.</td>', 'A good idea, nicely executed. i might''ve tried to capture at least a little of the milk hitting the side of the glass - but what you have works well.', '2006-07-26 03:49:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2661447, 369141, 60862, '<td valign="top">Heh.  I thought about this idea, too. :)</td>', 'Heh.  I thought about this idea, too. :)', '2006-07-26 04:05:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2661457, 367412, 60862, '<td valign="top">That large out of of focus thing near the top really draws my eye away from the part that''s in focus below it.  Which was your intended subject?</td>', 'That large out of of focus thing near the top really draws my eye away from the part that''s in focus below it.  Which was your intended subject?', '2006-07-26 04:05:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2661470, 366683, 60862, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition and lighting.  Way to go NOT deleting the double reflection and getting yourself DQd. :)</td>', 'Excellent composition and lighting.  Way to go NOT deleting the double reflection and getting yourself DQd. :)', '2006-07-26 04:06:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2661503, 369054, 60862, '<td valign="top">Chuckle.</td>', 'Chuckle.', '2006-07-26 04:09:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2661509, 368675, 60862, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, interesting angle.  Overall, though, it just doesn''t grab me.<br/> <br/>Maybe if the light were brighter, so the whites were lighter?</td>', 'Nice idea, interesting angle.  Overall, though, it just doesn''t grab me. Maybe if the light were brighter, so the whites were lighter?', '2006-07-26 04:09:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2661530, 369546, 60862, '<td valign="top">The basic idea is sound, and the DOF is nice, but it seems like a background waiting for a subject.<br/> <br/>There doesn''t seem to be any particular point of interest where you''ve chosen to make the focus sharp.  A hand, a metronome, or something attention-getting would add a lot to this shot.</td>', 'The basic idea is sound, and the DOF is nice, but it seems like a background waiting for a subject. There doesn''t seem to be any particular point of interest where you''ve chosen to make the focus sharp.  A hand, a metronome, or something attention-getting would add a lot to this shot.', '2006-07-26 04:11:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2661557, 369885, 60862, '<td valign="top">Almost in focus.  Sorry - couldn''t resist.<br/> <br/>Seriously - in focus and a little brighter, and I''d vote this much higher.  <br/> <br/>Given the current shot, I''m guessing you were inside, holding the camera in your hand.  If so, try to brace yourself against something solid.<br/> <br/>Another option is to set the exposure to about -1.  That''ll reduce the time the shutter''s open, which should reduce the blur, and you can brighten in software later.</td>', 'Almost in focus.  Sorry - couldn''t resist. Seriously - in focus and a little brighter, and I''d vote this much higher.   Given the current shot, I''m guessing you were inside, holding the camera in your hand.  If so, try to brace yourself against something solid. Another option is to set the exposure to about -1.  That''ll reduce the time the shutter''s open, which should reduce the blur, and you can brighten in software later.', '2006-07-26 04:14:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2661570, 369870, 60862, '<td valign="top">I liked the contrast in shapes, and then I LOVED your title. :)</td>', 'I liked the contrast in shapes, and then I LOVED your title. :)', '2006-07-26 04:15:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2661589, 367098, 60862, '<td valign="top">Good effort.  I like the continuous backdrop, the contrasting colors and shapes (and function), and how the handles are opposed.<br/> <br/>However ...<br/> <br/>it needs to be in focus and the lighting blows out the detail in the white cup.<br/> <br/>Try googling for "light tent" to learn about diffusing your light sources to avoid harsh reflections.  I''m far from good at it myself, but I''ve learned the theory anyway.</td>', 'Good effort.  I like the continuous backdrop, the contrasting colors and shapes (and function), and how the handles are opposed. However ... it needs to be in focus and the lighting blows out the detail in the white cup. Try googling for "light tent" to learn about diffusing your light sources to avoid harsh reflections.  I''m far from good at it myself, but I''ve learned the theory anyway.', '2006-07-26 04:17:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2661607, 368958, 60862, '<td valign="top">5 for the photo, plus 1 for the humor.  Is this Art or Fotomann?  Or another of our forum pranksters?</td>', '5 for the photo, plus 1 for the humor.  Is this Art or Fotomann?  Or another of our forum pranksters?', '2006-07-26 04:18:29.000000', NULL, 1),
