(2662566, 368128, 35602, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful.  Focus is really sharp and ant is nice and clear.  However, it doesn''t appear to be black and white.  I know the ant is black, but the flower commands the eye on this one.  Since many have done a wonderful job at keeping within the black and white idea, I can''t in good conscience give this one a high score, though if it were entered in flowers, or spots or something it would do much better.</td>', 'This is beautiful.  Focus is really sharp and ant is nice and clear.  However, it doesn''t appear to be black and white.  I know the ant is black, but the flower commands the eye on this one.  Since many have done a wonderful job at keeping within the black and white idea, I can''t in good conscience give this one a high score, though if it were entered in flowers, or spots or something it would do much better.', '2006-07-26 09:40:38.000000', NULL, 1),
