(2668544, 369680, 52500, '<td valign="top">That''s a cool statue, but I think everything is just too yellow/brown to work well in this challenge.  A touch of sharpening to bring out the detail and texture might help as well.</td>', 'That''s a cool statue, but I think everything is just too yellow/brown to work well in this challenge.  A touch of sharpening to bring out the detail and texture might help as well.', '2006-07-27 16:49:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2668552, 369831, 52500, '<td valign="top">Very good idea.  Much more interesting than any one of the 3 elements alone.  Great B/W tones.</td>', 'Very good idea.  Much more interesting than any one of the 3 elements alone.  Great B/W tones.', '2006-07-27 16:51:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2668561, 368286, 52500, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry, I just can''t get into this image.  The horizon is rather tilted, the background is busy, the light is harsh, and the subject is a beat up fake cow.  I applaud your effort and success in finding a B/W object, but it just doesn''t do it for me.</td>', 'I''m sorry, I just can''t get into this image.  The horizon is rather tilted, the background is busy, the light is harsh, and the subject is a beat up fake cow.  I applaud your effort and success in finding a B/W object, but it just doesn''t do it for me.', '2006-07-27 16:53:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2668565, 367002, 52500, '<td valign="top">I like the pop of color, but for this challenge I would have preferred a few black ones instead.  Very nice setup, and I love the high contrast.</td>', 'I like the pop of color, but for this challenge I would have preferred a few black ones instead.  Very nice setup, and I love the high contrast.', '2006-07-27 16:54:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2668575, 369027, 52500, '<td valign="top">Chess...the natural choice for a B/W challenge.  Why didn''t I think of that?  This is very well done.  I like the fairly shallow DOF.  My only gripe is the position of the pawn.  It is perfect composition wise, but it feels very strange to have a pawn on the edge of the board from a chess point of view.</td>', 'Chess...the natural choice for a B/W challenge.  Why didn''t I think of that?  This is very well done.  I like the fairly shallow DOF.  My only gripe is the position of the pawn.  It is perfect composition wise, but it feels very strange to have a pawn on the edge of the board from a chess point of view.', '2006-07-27 16:57:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2668584, 367992, 52500, '<td valign="top">Very pretty white tiger.  He really seems to be enjoying that snack as well!  Perfect subject, I would have liked to see this with a little more contrast, though, to help emphasize the B/W.</td>', 'Very pretty white tiger.  He really seems to be enjoying that snack as well!  Perfect subject, I would have liked to see this with a little more contrast, though, to help emphasize the B/W.', '2006-07-27 16:59:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2668591, 367691, 52500, '<td valign="top">Great idea.  These are fun to play with and look at.  Makes a cool photo.  It''s a tad dark, and I think a little more contrast would really bring out the black on white on black.  I think I found a subliminal message!  "he is a girly boy..."</td>', 'Great idea.  These are fun to play with and look at.  Makes a cool photo.  It''s a tad dark, and I think a little more contrast would really bring out the black on white on black.  I think I found a subliminal message!  "he is a girly boy..."', '2006-07-27 17:02:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2668595, 367981, 30028, '<td valign="top">BORING topic</td>', 'BORING topic', '2006-07-27 17:03:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2668599, 368580, 30028, '<td valign="top">ghastly fingers!!</td>', 'ghastly fingers!!', '2006-07-27 17:03:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2668600, 369346, 52500, '<td valign="top">Great idea, not very well executed.  The light seems pretty harsh, and there doesn''t seem to be anything in sharp focus.</td>', 'Great idea, not very well executed.  The light seems pretty harsh, and there doesn''t seem to be anything in sharp focus.', '2006-07-27 17:03:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2668604, 368255, 52500, '<td valign="top">I rather like the abstractness of it, but the whole thing seems rather dull.  It seems like it could use more contrast, but the whites are already blown on the pin.  Maybe overexposed?  (please note that I am a super amateur and may have no idea what I''m talking about)</td>', 'I rather like the abstractness of it, but the whole thing seems rather dull.  It seems like it could use more contrast, but the whites are already blown on the pin.  Maybe overexposed?  (please note that I am a super amateur and may have no idea what I''m talking about)', '2006-07-27 17:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2668606, 368110, 30028, '<td valign="top">wow... beautiful shot... almost surreal!</td>', 'wow... beautiful shot... almost surreal!', '2006-07-27 17:06:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2668618, 367833, 56828, '<td valign="top">I would have liked to have seen more of the door.</td>', 'I would have liked to have seen more of the door.', '2006-07-27 17:07:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2668622, 369675, 30028, '<td valign="top">loved the simplicity</td>', 'loved the simplicity', '2006-07-27 17:08:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2668624, 368984, 56828, '<td valign="top">Nice photo.  Would have been better if there were more contrast.</td>', 'Nice photo.  Would have been better if there were more contrast.', '2006-07-27 17:08:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2668629, 369263, 52500, '<td valign="top">A decent picture of some nice artwork.  It would work much better if the background were actually white instead of yellow/brown, and it''s quite small.</td>', 'A decent picture of some nice artwork.  It would work much better if the background were actually white instead of yellow/brown, and it''s quite small.', '2006-07-27 17:08:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2668630, 369001, 56828, '<td valign="top">Besides the eyes FREAKING me out...your light is a tad bit too harsh.</td>', 'Besides the eyes FREAKING me out...your light is a tad bit too harsh.', '2006-07-27 17:08:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2668638, 369856, 56828, '<td valign="top">You can barely make out that it''s Frank''s nose.  Nice sharp photo though.</td>', 'You can barely make out that it''s Frank''s nose.  Nice sharp photo though.', '2006-07-27 17:09:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2668639, 369453, 52500, '<td valign="top">Mmmm...that looks appetizing.  Nice B/W, but the focus seems a little soft.</td>', 'Mmmm...that looks appetizing.  Nice B/W, but the focus seems a little soft.', '2006-07-27 17:09:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2668645, 369862, 30028, '<td valign="top">love the focus on this one...</td>', 'love the focus on this one...', '2006-07-27 17:10:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2668647, 367830, 56828, '<td valign="top">Just not enough focus in the shot.</td>', 'Just not enough focus in the shot.', '2006-07-27 17:10:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2668648, 368977, 30028, '<td valign="top">very creative</td>', 'very creative', '2006-07-27 17:10:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2668649, 366321, 52500, '<td valign="top">This is fantastic.  Unlike those other horrible people, I love cats and cat pictures.  I''m also a big fan of high contrast images.  Such a pretty kitty!  Very nice composition as well.</td>', 'This is fantastic.  Unlike those other horrible people, I love cats and cat pictures.  I''m also a big fan of high contrast images.  Such a pretty kitty!  Very nice composition as well.', '2006-07-27 17:11:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2668653, 369413, 56828, '<td valign="top">I think this could hvae been better had it been rotated 90 degrees CCW.  It forces you to try and turn your head to the side.  Also more contrast would have worked.</td>', 'I think this could hvae been better had it been rotated 90 degrees CCW.  It forces you to try and turn your head to the side.  Also more contrast would have worked.', '2006-07-27 17:11:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2668658, 367537, 56828, '<td valign="top">Very very blurry.  It''s blurry enough that it looks purposely blurred, but it just doesn''t suit me.</td>', 'Very very blurry.  It''s blurry enough that it looks purposely blurred, but it just doesn''t suit me.', '2006-07-27 17:13:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2668659, 369453, 30028, '<td valign="top">loved the idea... excellent composition</td>', 'loved the idea... excellent composition', '2006-07-27 17:13:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2668660, 369873, 56828, '<td valign="top">Black and white?  Bench looks brown.</td>', 'Black and white?  Bench looks brown.', '2006-07-27 17:13:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2668661, 368715, 52500, '<td valign="top">Pretty kitty, but not an overly interesting shot.  Great title, though.  (S)he does seem quite bored with you and the camera!</td>', 'Pretty kitty, but not an overly interesting shot.  Great title, though.  (S)he does seem quite bored with you and the camera!', '2006-07-27 17:13:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2668663, 369862, 56828, '<td valign="top">Your snake actually looks tan and white.  Very sharp photo though.  Nice focus.  Great lighting.</td>', 'Your snake actually looks tan and white.  Very sharp photo though.  Nice focus.  Great lighting.', '2006-07-27 17:14:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2668666, 369568, 52500, '<td valign="top">That''s a pretty cool piece of machinery.  Looks great with the shadows.  Nice time of day you chose here.</td>', 'That''s a pretty cool piece of machinery.  Looks great with the shadows.  Nice time of day you chose here.', '2006-07-27 17:14:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2668667, 369114, 30028, '<td valign="top">too many things</td>', 'too many things', '2006-07-27 17:14:41.000000', NULL, 1),
