(2668676, 369054, 52500, '<td valign="top">Good job turning the ol'' joke into an entry.  Unfortunately for me, the photo itself is not very interesting.  Still, a 5 for humor.</td>', 'Good job turning the ol'' joke into an entry.  Unfortunately for me, the photo itself is not very interesting.  Still, a 5 for humor.', '2006-07-27 17:15:47.000000', NULL, 1),
