(2668695, 369763, 52500, '<td valign="top">If there was ever a good challenge for a zebra, this is it.  Looks great.  I love all of the little hairs around the mouth.</td>', 'If there was ever a good challenge for a zebra, this is it.  Looks great.  I love all of the little hairs around the mouth.', '2006-07-27 17:18:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2668702, 369482, 52500, '<td valign="top">Those are really cool cups.  The perfect subject for this challenge.  DOF is right on.  Did you make those or did you find them somewhere?</td>', 'Those are really cool cups.  The perfect subject for this challenge.  DOF is right on.  Did you make those or did you find them somewhere?', '2006-07-27 17:20:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2668707, 369546, 52500, '<td valign="top">Black and White indeed.  Technically good, but there really isn''t anything to hold my interest after the initial glance.  Perhaps a crazy angle would help.  Anyway, it''s a good shot.  6</td>', 'Black and White indeed.  Technically good, but there really isn''t anything to hold my interest after the initial glance.  Perhaps a crazy angle would help.  Anyway, it''s a good shot.  6', '2006-07-27 17:21:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2668712, 368984, 52500, '<td valign="top">I like the angle you used here, but it''s very grainy/noisy in the blacks.</td>', 'I like the angle you used here, but it''s very grainy/noisy in the blacks.', '2006-07-27 17:22:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2668717, 369413, 52500, '<td valign="top">Nice title.  This is a cool idea, but the technicals seem to be lacking a bit.  The white spool is quite blown out, but it could really still use some contrast.  Seems a bit overexposed.</td>', 'Nice title.  This is a cool idea, but the technicals seem to be lacking a bit.  The white spool is quite blown out, but it could really still use some contrast.  Seems a bit overexposed.', '2006-07-27 17:24:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2668724, 369688, 52500, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.  The sign looks great against the wispy white clouds in the sky (especially with the slight blue tint to the sign.)  The only thing I don''t like would be the fingers just barely visible under the sign.</td>', 'Nice idea.  The sign looks great against the wispy white clouds in the sky (especially with the slight blue tint to the sign.)  The only thing I don''t like would be the fingers just barely visible under the sign.', '2006-07-27 17:26:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2668729, 369713, 52500, '<td valign="top">Pretty cool looking, and I love a good abstract.  It does seem a bit busy, though.  Maybe fewer little bubbles and one or two larger ones?</td>', 'Pretty cool looking, and I love a good abstract.  It does seem a bit busy, though.  Maybe fewer little bubbles and one or two larger ones?', '2006-07-27 17:27:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2668737, 369624, 52500, '<td valign="top">Cute kitty.  I like the fairly shallow DOF, but I would rather not be able to see the edge of the towel at the top.  Focus seems a bit soft as well.  Looks like (s)he is enjoying quite the nap!</td>', 'Cute kitty.  I like the fairly shallow DOF, but I would rather not be able to see the edge of the towel at the top.  Focus seems a bit soft as well.  Looks like (s)he is enjoying quite the nap!', '2006-07-27 17:28:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2668740, 367368, 52500, '<td valign="top">Some fun refractions in that crazy glass thing.  I think I personally would like this more with a really close crop on the thing making it more abstract.</td>', 'Some fun refractions in that crazy glass thing.  I think I personally would like this more with a really close crop on the thing making it more abstract.', '2006-07-27 17:30:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2668764, 367259, 52500, '<td valign="top">Fabulous.  Love the DOF.  It creates a really cool effect in the 3.  Great emotion here as well.  It takes me back to those good ol'' days.</td>', 'Fabulous.  Love the DOF.  It creates a really cool effect in the 3.  Great emotion here as well.  It takes me back to those good ol'' days.', '2006-07-27 17:36:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2668773, 369076, 52500, '<td valign="top">While there is a lot of color in this photo, it still <i>feels</i> like it''s B/W.  Great work!</td>', 'While there is a lot of color in this photo, it still feels like it''s B/W.  Great work!', '2006-07-27 17:37:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2668811, 369601, 52500, '<td valign="top">One of the better piano shots.  I like the angle and the DOF.</td>', 'One of the better piano shots.  I like the angle and the DOF.', '2006-07-27 17:48:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2668820, 366563, 52500, '<td valign="top">Very cool.  I really like the placement and the angle of the feather and the reflection.  I think I would like it better nice and clean (no little bits of white stuff).</td>', 'Very cool.  I really like the placement and the angle of the feather and the reflection.  I think I would like it better nice and clean (no little bits of white stuff).', '2006-07-27 17:50:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2668823, 369421, 52500, '<td valign="top">One of the better feather shots.  A touch of USM and this would be even better.</td>', 'One of the better feather shots.  A touch of USM and this would be even better.', '2006-07-27 17:52:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2668831, 368338, 52500, '<td valign="top">Very well done.  Such a large amount of detail in the blacks.</td>', 'Very well done.  Such a large amount of detail in the blacks.', '2006-07-27 17:54:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2668833, 369297, 52500, '<td valign="top">Great texture.  It almost looks like tree bark!</td>', 'Great texture.  It almost looks like tree bark!', '2006-07-27 17:54:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2668838, 369134, 52500, '<td valign="top">Nice.  I''m quite amazed by the nature/landscape shots like this with very little color.  Very well done.</td>', 'Nice.  I''m quite amazed by the nature/landscape shots like this with very little color.  Very well done.', '2006-07-27 17:55:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2668843, 369133, 52500, '<td valign="top">This is quite trippy.  I had to stare at it for a while to figure out what was going on.  The grain works perfectly.</td>', 'This is quite trippy.  I had to stare at it for a while to figure out what was going on.  The grain works perfectly.', '2006-07-27 17:56:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2668844, 369656, 52500, '<td valign="top">Those guys are quite greyscale, but the blue is pretty overwhelming.  Wonderful shot, just not quite right for this challenge.</td>', 'Those guys are quite greyscale, but the blue is pretty overwhelming.  Wonderful shot, just not quite right for this challenge.', '2006-07-27 17:57:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2668856, 369336, 52500, '<td valign="top">I''m not a big fan of pictures of pictures.  The camera and film give it a bit of story, though, which helps.</td>', 'I''m not a big fan of pictures of pictures.  The camera and film give it a bit of story, though, which helps.', '2006-07-27 17:58:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2668858, 369841, 52500, '<td valign="top">Nice.  I love a good abstract.  Those curved are just gorgeous.</td>', 'Nice.  I love a good abstract.  Those curved are just gorgeous.', '2006-07-27 17:59:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2668862, 367214, 52500, '<td valign="top">Simple and to the point.  Nice and sharp.  My cats don''t really like to pose for the camera.  Hope (s)he was more cooperative!</td>', 'Simple and to the point.  Nice and sharp.  My cats don''t really like to pose for the camera.  Hope (s)he was more cooperative!', '2006-07-27 18:00:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2668871, 369810, 52500, '<td valign="top">This has obviously been done many times, but I haven''t seen one quite like this before.  Great refractions.</td>', 'This has obviously been done many times, but I haven''t seen one quite like this before.  Great refractions.', '2006-07-27 18:01:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2668879, 369888, 52500, '<td valign="top">Is this the underside of a bridge?  Very cool point of view.</td>', 'Is this the underside of a bridge?  Very cool point of view.', '2006-07-27 18:02:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2668891, 369856, 55956, '<td valign="top">too much dark...</td>', 'too much dark...', '2006-07-27 18:05:06.000000', NULL, 1),
