(2672099, 368128, 33560, '<td valign="top">Had this been a flower challenge you could have cloned out the subject of this photo.  Still, it''s a funny  photo and i appreciate the break from severe B&amp;W.</td>', 'Had this been a flower challenge you could have cloned out the subject of this photo.  Still, it''s a funny  photo and i appreciate the break from severe B&W.', '2006-07-28 17:56:11.000000', NULL, 1),
