(2673399, 369332, 56400, '<td valign="top">Good shot but, I think seeing the inside of the mask through the one eye is a little distracting. Maybe a dark colored magic marker (or a dry erase marker for non-permanance)on the inside of the mask would have helped.</td>', 'Good shot but, I think seeing the inside of the mask through the one eye is a little distracting. Maybe a dark colored magic marker (or a dry erase marker for non-permanance)on the inside of the mask would have helped.', '2006-07-29 05:58:57.000000', NULL, 1),
