(2673440, 368494, 62554, '<td valign="top">Some definition between the bowl and cup would have been advantageous, but overall, nice tones, good compo, good use of DoF and interesting subject.</td>', 'Some definition between the bowl and cup would have been advantageous, but overall, nice tones, good compo, good use of DoF and interesting subject.', '2006-07-29 06:53:54.000000', NULL, 1),
