(2673721, 368826, 58330, '<td valign="top">I cant help chuckling at this and enjoy going back to it. You have definitely met the challenge better than many and the cropping makes it for me.</td>', 'I cant help chuckling at this and enjoy going back to it. You have definitely met the challenge better than many and the cropping makes it for me.', '2006-07-29 11:19:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2673741, 369649, 59230, '<td valign="top">Very nice picture!<br/> <br/>But there are three things that could be better:<br/> <br/>1) There are jaggies on the "ship".<br/>2) There is halo around the "ship".<br/>3) The horizon is not level.<br/> <br/>But - the photo is attractive, and I hope the best with it!</td>', 'Very nice picture! But there are three things that could be better: 1) There are jaggies on the "ship".2) There is halo around the "ship".3) The horizon is not level. But - the photo is attractive, and I hope the best with it!', '2006-07-29 11:32:39.000000', NULL, 1),
