(2673924, 369787, 45596, '<td valign="top">I like kitty kats and have a tendacy to give a higher score, however there are voters who will do the opposite.  Check out this link.  In particular, rule #38 <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/forum.php?action=read&amp;FORUM_THREAD_ID=374470" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Guide to DPC</a></td>', 'I like kitty kats and have a tendacy to give a higher score, however there are voters who will do the opposite.  Check out this link.  In particular, rule #38 Guide to DPC', '2006-07-29 13:28:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2673930, 369298, 45596, '<td valign="top">I came very close to entering a similar photo.  I chose not to because it seemed too obvious a subject matter.  I was looking for more creativity.  Thus, this is a good photo, but lacks originality.</td>', 'I came very close to entering a similar photo.  I chose not to because it seemed too obvious a subject matter.  I was looking for more creativity.  Thus, this is a good photo, but lacks originality.', '2006-07-29 13:32:37.000000', NULL, 1),
