(2674309, 368675, 45596, '<td valign="top">I believe the intention of the challenge was to take a b&amp;w photo in color mode.  This is why desaturation was discouraged.  I don''t think the challenge was to shoot a color photo with b&amp;W in it.  It may be a suttle difference in interpretation.  The perspective in this photo is interesting.</td>', 'I believe the intention of the challenge was to take a b&w photo in color mode.  This is why desaturation was discouraged.  I don''t think the challenge was to shoot a color photo with b&W in it.  It may be a suttle difference in interpretation.  The perspective in this photo is interesting.', '2006-07-29 16:25:56.000000', NULL, 1),
