(2674838, 369869, 60862, '<td valign="top">Very clever!  I like how you got the carriage pointing toward the blue.  Perfectly aligns with the title.</td>', 'Very clever!  I like how you got the carriage pointing toward the blue.  Perfectly aligns with the title.', '2006-07-29 21:31:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2674844, 369755, 60862, '<td valign="top">Funny title. :)<br/> <br/>Ordinarily, I''d suggest framing the horse''s head further in.  But the face is so dead square-on facing the camera that it makes a really nice stopping point as my eye sweeps up the body.  And for this challenge in particular, it''s great to fill nearly the entire width with B&amp;W.<br/> <br/>7.</td>', 'Funny title. :) Ordinarily, I''d suggest framing the horse''s head further in.  But the face is so dead square-on facing the camera that it makes a really nice stopping point as my eye sweeps up the body.  And for this challenge in particular, it''s great to fill nearly the entire width with B&W. 7.', '2006-07-29 21:33:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2674847, 367673, 60862, '<td valign="top">Very pretty, great symmetry!</td>', 'Very pretty, great symmetry!', '2006-07-29 21:33:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2674854, 367445, 29451, '<td valign="top">About 1 in 649739...  Nice photo, good sharpness on the cards, I might have liked it better if the background were all black.</td>', 'About 1 in 649739...  Nice photo, good sharpness on the cards, I might have liked it better if the background were all black.', '2006-07-29 21:41:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2674863, 367537, 60862, '<td valign="top">I''m going to assume you intended to enter something so out of focus there''s nothing to, well, focus my eyes on.  So it was supposed to be abstract.  As opposed to taking a blurry picture and entering it just for kicks.<br/> <br/>Under that assumption, it''s not striking me as a very interesting composition.  And the left edge of the white thing is pretty centered, so there''s not much negative space to contrast with the white area.<br/> <br/>But I''ll give you a 5 for the effort and idea.</td>', 'I''m going to assume you intended to enter something so out of focus there''s nothing to, well, focus my eyes on.  So it was supposed to be abstract.  As opposed to taking a blurry picture and entering it just for kicks. Under that assumption, it''s not striking me as a very interesting composition.  And the left edge of the white thing is pretty centered, so there''s not much negative space to contrast with the white area. But I''ll give you a 5 for the effort and idea.', '2006-07-29 21:45:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2674867, 368106, 60862, '<td valign="top">I like the rotation here.  It makes a more interesting shot than the other piano key entries.  And the title suggest some personification,  like the keys are guards standing watch.</td>', 'I like the rotation here.  It makes a more interesting shot than the other piano key entries.  And the title suggest some personification,  like the keys are guards standing watch.', '2006-07-29 21:46:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2674868, 368827, 60862, '<td valign="top">Pretty picture, and good title.  However, the emotional impact, and the story based on the title, is entirely about new growth in color replacing a dead, B&amp;W area.  That takes it out of the challenge for me.</td>', 'Pretty picture, and good title.  However, the emotional impact, and the story based on the title, is entirely about new growth in color replacing a dead, B&W area.  That takes it out of the challenge for me.', '2006-07-29 21:47:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2674870, 369787, 60862, '<td valign="top">Funny. :)</td>', 'Funny. :)', '2006-07-29 21:47:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2674876, 367214, 60862, '<td valign="top">Nice angle and composition!  My only nitpick would be to suggest a slightly deeper DOF so the nose is in focus. 7.</td>', 'Nice angle and composition!  My only nitpick would be to suggest a slightly deeper DOF so the nose is in focus. 7.', '2006-07-29 21:49:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2674880, 369413, 60862, '<td valign="top">A little overexposed.  I assume you intended that, but it doesn''t strike me as being as interesting as if I could see detail on the thread.</td>', 'A little overexposed.  I assume you intended that, but it doesn''t strike me as being as interesting as if I could see detail on the thread.', '2006-07-29 21:51:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2674884, 369804, 60862, '<td valign="top">Several folks have taken pictures of piano keys for this challenge.  Look around for other ideas.<br/> <br/> <br/>This angle is too dead-on for it to hold my interest.</td>', 'Several folks have taken pictures of piano keys for this challenge.  Look around for other ideas.  This angle is too dead-on for it to hold my interest.', '2006-07-29 21:52:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2674886, 367949, 60862, '<td valign="top">Good idea, and the shirt collar hanging in space is eye-catching.  I just wish the whites were truly white instead of being so dark.  Maybe that''s to hide what''s holding up the clothes?</td>', 'Good idea, and the shirt collar hanging in space is eye-catching.  I just wish the whites were truly white instead of being so dark.  Maybe that''s to hide what''s holding up the clothes?', '2006-07-29 21:53:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2674889, 369264, 60862, '<td valign="top">I like your title, and it fits well.</td>', 'I like your title, and it fits well.', '2006-07-29 21:53:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2674895, 368393, 60862, '<td valign="top">I know some folks will probably vote lower since there''s so much color here, but hey, the subject''s B&amp;W!  The composition is nice.</td>', 'I know some folks will probably vote lower since there''s so much color here, but hey, the subject''s B&W!  The composition is nice.', '2006-07-29 21:54:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2674897, 369821, 60862, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot!</td>', 'Very nice shot!', '2006-07-29 21:54:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2674898, 368043, 60862, '<td valign="top">Out of focus ...</td>', 'Out of focus ...', '2006-07-29 21:55:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2674902, 369341, 60862, '<td valign="top">I like how you included just enough of the text to clue us in that it''s a farmer''s market, but this still strikes me as basically a picture of a sign, without a whole lot of photographic interest.</td>', 'I like how you included just enough of the text to clue us in that it''s a farmer''s market, but this still strikes me as basically a picture of a sign, without a whole lot of photographic interest.', '2006-07-29 21:56:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2674903, 369818, 60862, '<td valign="top">Interesting interpretation.  Did you pump up the saturation of his eyes?</td>', 'Interesting interpretation.  Did you pump up the saturation of his eyes?', '2006-07-29 21:56:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2674913, 369838, 29451, '<td valign="top">Cool idea, nicely done - great composition and contrast.</td>', 'Cool idea, nicely done - great composition and contrast.', '2006-07-29 22:03:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2674915, 368768, 29451, '<td valign="top">I love how the water looks almost metallic - beautiful photo, not sure if it meets the challenge, but oh well.</td>', 'I love how the water looks almost metallic - beautiful photo, not sure if it meets the challenge, but oh well.', '2006-07-29 22:04:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2674921, 367841, 29451, '<td valign="top">A penguin! Yay!  Nice profile of the little guy, I could never get one to pose so nicely.  Great photo.</td>', 'A penguin! Yay!  Nice profile of the little guy, I could never get one to pose so nicely.  Great photo.', '2006-07-29 22:05:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2674922, 369333, 60862, '<td valign="top">Ah, a very nice alternative to my shot! :)<br/> <br/>Very nicely done.</td>', 'Ah, a very nice alternative to my shot! :) Very nicely done.', '2006-07-29 22:06:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2674930, 369343, 60862, '<td valign="top">I really like the outstretched wing.  A new angle on a common subject.</td>', 'I really like the outstretched wing.  A new angle on a common subject.', '2006-07-29 22:09:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2674933, 367684, 60862, '<td valign="top">Another variation on the same concept as my entry.  I like it!</td>', 'Another variation on the same concept as my entry.  I like it!', '2006-07-29 22:10:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2674938, 369876, 60862, '<td valign="top">Interesting abstract!</td>', 'Interesting abstract!', '2006-07-29 22:15:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2674939, 368826, 60862, '<td valign="top">GREAT angle! :)</td>', 'GREAT angle! :)', '2006-07-29 22:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2674991, 367428, 60862, '<td valign="top">The colors are the main eyecatching part of this photo, which says to me it''s not meeting the challenge.<br/> <br/>Cool photo, though!</td>', 'The colors are the main eyecatching part of this photo, which says to me it''s not meeting the challenge. Cool photo, though!', '2006-07-29 22:53:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2674993, 366972, 60862, '<td valign="top">Neat abstract.</td>', 'Neat abstract.', '2006-07-29 22:53:30.000000', NULL, 1),
