(2675049, 369831, 62493, '<td valign="top">The smoke doesn''t quite look like it is coming out of the clarinet (at least to my eyes) but this is a clever and well shot (imho) submission.</td>', 'The smoke doesn''t quite look like it is coming out of the clarinet (at least to my eyes) but this is a clever and well shot (imho) submission.', '2006-07-29 23:26:08.000000', NULL, 1),
