(2675116, 368368, 45790, '<td valign="top">But mostly grey. Nicely sharp!</td>', 'But mostly grey. Nicely sharp!', '2006-07-29 23:51:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2675119, 367616, 45790, '<td valign="top">Good choice of dog. :-) I also like this on the side better than it would have been with the conventional right-side-up.</td>', 'Good choice of dog. :-) I also like this on the side better than it would have been with the conventional right-side-up.', '2006-07-29 23:52:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2675122, 369734, 45790, '<td valign="top">Nicely done!</td>', 'Nicely done!', '2006-07-29 23:53:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2675125, 369079, 45790, '<td valign="top">Nice reflections on pearls. Good composition.</td>', 'Nice reflections on pearls. Good composition.', '2006-07-29 23:54:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2675126, 369713, 45790, '<td valign="top">Fun abstract picture.</td>', 'Fun abstract picture.', '2006-07-29 23:54:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2675127, 368225, 45790, '<td valign="top">I don''t like cats, but I love this picture.</td>', 'I don''t like cats, but I love this picture.', '2006-07-29 23:54:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2675129, 369404, 45790, '<td valign="top">Nice composition with good lighting.</td>', 'Nice composition with good lighting.', '2006-07-29 23:55:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2675133, 368106, 45790, '<td valign="top">Good choice of angle, especially considering the competition.  I would have liked foreground in focus.</td>', 'Good choice of angle, especially considering the competition.  I would have liked foreground in focus.', '2006-07-29 23:56:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2675136, 369773, 45790, '<td valign="top">Nice image, with only negative being your reflection in the balls.</td>', 'Nice image, with only negative being your reflection in the balls.', '2006-07-29 23:56:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2675139, 369753, 45790, '<td valign="top">Interesting picture with good composition but annoying glare.</td>', 'Interesting picture with good composition but annoying glare.', '2006-07-29 23:58:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2675141, 367445, 45790, '<td valign="top">Are the cards so old they are yellowing? Or is the white balance off. You should be able to achieve "perfect" black and white with this one.</td>', 'Are the cards so old they are yellowing? Or is the white balance off. You should be able to achieve "perfect" black and white with this one.', '2006-07-29 23:59:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2675143, 368043, 45790, '<td valign="top">Dirty and not sharp. This would be interesting if clean, focused, and contrast brought up.</td>', 'Dirty and not sharp. This would be interesting if clean, focused, and contrast brought up.', '2006-07-29 23:59:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2675144, 366456, 45790, '<td valign="top">Why is that colorful plant in the way?</td>', 'Why is that colorful plant in the way?', '2006-07-30 00:00:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2675147, 368827, 45790, '<td valign="top">I really like this picture and the statement it is making. Interesting composition and contrast. However I don''t think it really fits the challenge description and I expect that your score will be hurt.</td>', 'I really like this picture and the statement it is making. Interesting composition and contrast. However I don''t think it really fits the challenge description and I expect that your score will be hurt.', '2006-07-30 00:01:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2675148, 367537, 45790, '<td valign="top">This doesn''t hold my interest. Sure I can''t tell what it is, but I wouldn''t call it an enigma. Might just be a heavily shadowed egg that is out of focus.</td>', 'This doesn''t hold my interest. Sure I can''t tell what it is, but I wouldn''t call it an enigma. Might just be a heavily shadowed egg that is out of focus.', '2006-07-30 00:01:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2675149, 369001, 45790, '<td valign="top">The flash makes the non-black-and-white eyes glow, gives strong ugly shadow on the wall and brings out the door in the background. Bottom line -- don''t use the flash.</td>', 'The flash makes the non-black-and-white eyes glow, gives strong ugly shadow on the wall and brings out the door in the background. Bottom line -- don''t use the flash.', '2006-07-30 00:02:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2675151, 368260, 45790, '<td valign="top">This would have been a great picture if the out of focus owl in the foreground were not blocking the white owl.</td>', 'This would have been a great picture if the out of focus owl in the foreground were not blocking the white owl.', '2006-07-30 00:02:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2675156, 369044, 45790, '<td valign="top">More even lighting needed. Overexposure and CA are annoying.</td>', 'More even lighting needed. Overexposure and CA are annoying.', '2006-07-30 00:03:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2675160, 369706, 45790, '<td valign="top">Way too colorful. Needs more DOF, and creame is overexposed. While I am at it, use a cup that isn''t stained.</td>', 'Way too colorful. Needs more DOF, and creame is overexposed. While I am at it, use a cup that isn''t stained.', '2006-07-30 00:04:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2675314, 369029, 60862, '<td valign="top">Laugh.  Interesting pic to start with, making you wonder what''s going on.  And then the title completes the thought perfectly!<br/> <br/>7 for the shot plus 1 for the creativity.  And going in my favorites.</td>', 'Laugh.  Interesting pic to start with, making you wonder what''s going on.  And then the title completes the thought perfectly! 7 for the shot plus 1 for the creativity.  And going in my favorites.', '2006-07-30 00:51:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2675326, 369141, 38407, '<td valign="top">good idea. a little over processed though</td>', 'good idea. a little over processed though', '2006-07-30 00:56:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2675329, 369143, 60862, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry, but the subject in ths photo is the guy, not the black and white suit and the shades.<br/> <br/>I like the shot, but I don''t think it meets the challenge.</td>', 'I''m sorry, but the subject in ths photo is the guy, not the black and white suit and the shades. I like the shot, but I don''t think it meets the challenge.', '2006-07-30 00:56:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2675339, 369831, 60862, '<td valign="top">The smoke almost made me downgrade, because it distracts from the beautiful line of the clarinet.  But ... then I noticed the names on the music and the connection was very clear.</td>', 'The smoke almost made me downgrade, because it distracts from the beautiful line of the clarinet.  But ... then I noticed the names on the music and the connection was very clear.', '2006-07-30 00:58:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2675342, 369616, 60862, '<td valign="top">Best shot I''ve seen yet of a keyboard or buttons.  And I like how it''s blown up way beyond normal dimensions.  It''s still a little flat and too straight-on, but that''s minor.</td>', 'Best shot I''ve seen yet of a keyboard or buttons.  And I like how it''s blown up way beyond normal dimensions.  It''s still a little flat and too straight-on, but that''s minor.', '2006-07-30 00:59:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2675348, 369283, 60862, '<td valign="top">What''s the B&amp;W subject?  Her dress?</td>', 'What''s the B&W subject?  Her dress?', '2006-07-30 01:01:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2675350, 369770, 60862, '<td valign="top">I like how the drink matches the background, turning the cup into an abstract shape.</td>', 'I like how the drink matches the background, turning the cup into an abstract shape.', '2006-07-30 01:02:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2675357, 368179, 60862, '<td valign="top">Not in focus, and the shot''s too straight on.  Not for the challenge, but try an angle from the side or from close in but looking up at the nose against the ceiling.  Also try different lighting so you create some dramatic shadows.</td>', 'Not in focus, and the shot''s too straight on.  Not for the challenge, but try an angle from the side or from close in but looking up at the nose against the ceiling.  Also try different lighting so you create some dramatic shadows.', '2006-07-30 01:04:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2675367, 369473, 60862, '<td valign="top">Snicker.  Yep, they are.<br/> <br/>The title helps me relax about the focus, since now it seems like the dice are moving while someone shoots craps.  It''d be better if it showed motion trails, as another dice shot did.<br/> <br/>But that''s a bit too much of a reach, since I generally think the photo should stand on its own.</td>', 'Snicker.  Yep, they are. The title helps me relax about the focus, since now it seems like the dice are moving while someone shoots craps.  It''d be better if it showed motion trails, as another dice shot did. But that''s a bit too much of a reach, since I generally think the photo should stand on its own.', '2006-07-30 01:07:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2675371, 369734, 60862, '<td valign="top">Nice motion trail to show why they''re not in perfect focus.</td>', 'Nice motion trail to show why they''re not in perfect focus.', '2006-07-30 01:07:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2675377, 369682, 60862, '<td valign="top">Interesting angle.</td>', 'Interesting angle.', '2006-07-30 01:09:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2675381, 368200, 60862, '<td valign="top">Clever.</td>', 'Clever.', '2006-07-30 01:10:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2675384, 367882, 60862, '<td valign="top">I''m glad you got validated.  I hope you''ll share how you got the tones so B&amp;W!</td>', 'I''m glad you got validated.  I hope you''ll share how you got the tones so B&W!', '2006-07-30 01:11:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2675391, 369588, 60862, '<td valign="top">This evokes strong emotions of abandonment or loneliness.  Cropping it with the window so high also really brings to mind a cell or some similar room where the gloominess is emphasized by a high wall.<br/> <br/>Great job! Going in my favorites.</td>', 'This evokes strong emotions of abandonment or loneliness.  Cropping it with the window so high also really brings to mind a cell or some similar room where the gloominess is emphasized by a high wall. Great job! Going in my favorites.', '2006-07-30 01:14:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2675392, 369861, 60862, '<td valign="top">Wow.  Disturbing and intruiging at the same time. 9.</td>', 'Wow.  Disturbing and intruiging at the same time. 9.', '2006-07-30 01:14:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2675394, 367624, 60862, '<td valign="top">Must''ve been tough to choose this or the gold challenge.<br/> <br/>I like this shot a lot.  I have no problem with allowing color in this challenge as long as the subject''s B&amp;W.  And you met that well here.<br/> <br/>The cropping does a great job of showing what he''s dangling over, emphasizing the tension in the photo.<br/> <br/>This is going in my favorites.  It doesn''t hurt that I used to climb. :)</td>', 'Must''ve been tough to choose this or the gold challenge. I like this shot a lot.  I have no problem with allowing color in this challenge as long as the subject''s B&W.  And you met that well here. The cropping does a great job of showing what he''s dangling over, emphasizing the tension in the photo. This is going in my favorites.  It doesn''t hurt that I used to climb. :)', '2006-07-30 01:15:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2675395, 368394, 60862, '<td valign="top">EXCELLENT!  Can''t wait to hear how you did this.  Is it a mask?<br/> <br/>This is my favorite of the challenge, and is going in my favorites.</td>', 'EXCELLENT!  Can''t wait to hear how you did this.  Is it a mask? This is my favorite of the challenge, and is going in my favorites.', '2006-07-30 01:15:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2675396, 368544, 60862, '<td valign="top">Wow - great shot!</td>', 'Wow - great shot!', '2006-07-30 01:15:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2675397, 367969, 60862, '<td valign="top">Wow.  I''ll say that''s a stare!  Great shot!</td>', 'Wow.  I''ll say that''s a stare!  Great shot!', '2006-07-30 01:15:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2675398, 369368, 60862, '<td valign="top">Great use of DOF to get across your point.  The title''s almost an afterthought because the picture communicates so well.</td>', 'Great use of DOF to get across your point.  The title''s almost an afterthought because the picture communicates so well.', '2006-07-30 01:15:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2675402, 369649, 60862, '<td valign="top">Wow, what a charged scene!  That''s a sculpture, I take it?<br/> <br/>This is a great example of how a 2-D photo of a 3-D artwork can show the photographer''s touch through framing, choice of lighting (even if it''s a time of day to put the sun in the right spot), and choice of background (heavy, roiling clouds as opposed to a blue sky).<br/> <br/>Well done!</td>', 'Wow, what a charged scene!  That''s a sculpture, I take it? This is a great example of how a 2-D photo of a 3-D artwork can show the photographer''s touch through framing, choice of lighting (even if it''s a time of day to put the sun in the right spot), and choice of background (heavy, roiling clouds as opposed to a blue sky). Well done!', '2006-07-30 01:17:14.000000', NULL, 1),
