(2676512, 369649, 57229, '<td valign="top">Could be I''m just looking for excuses to mark down Icelandic pictures, but the sea and sky are not as grey as you have made them here. Maybe they are, but it doesn''t look that way, so...<br/>That''s a shame, because the picture as a whole benefits from being monochromatic.</td>', 'Could be I''m just looking for excuses to mark down Icelandic pictures, but the sea and sky are not as grey as you have made them here. Maybe they are, but it doesn''t look that way, so...That''s a shame, because the picture as a whole benefits from being monochromatic.', '2006-07-30 17:49:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2676516, 369376, 57229, '<td valign="top">The trouble with shots like this is that I know there''s colour there and I can''t see it. If that patch of sunshine had managed to fetch out a flash of colour then it would enhance the greyness of the rest by contrast. As it is it just looks desaturated. I expect it was quite exciting weather, but I''m afraid the drama didn''t reach me...</td>', 'The trouble with shots like this is that I know there''s colour there and I can''t see it. If that patch of sunshine had managed to fetch out a flash of colour then it would enhance the greyness of the rest by contrast. As it is it just looks desaturated. I expect it was quite exciting weather, but I''m afraid the drama didn''t reach me...', '2006-07-30 17:51:04.000000', NULL, 1),
