(2682714, 366321, 23965, '<td valign="top">Great texture &amp; lighting. Saturation may be a bit overdone, but the image stopped me in my tracks. First time comment. Cats are not easy subjects, especially black cats. Congrats.</td>', 'Great texture & lighting. Saturation may be a bit overdone, but the image stopped me in my tracks. First time comment. Cats are not easy subjects, especially black cats. Congrats.', '2006-08-01 03:19:05.000000', NULL, 1),
