(2682734, 369684, 23965, '<td valign="top">Simple everyday foods. Perfect timing and exposure....almost looks like it''s modelled from plastic. Neat idea. Super execution.</td>', 'Simple everyday foods. Perfect timing and exposure....almost looks like it''s modelled from plastic. Neat idea. Super execution.', '2006-08-01 03:23:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2682736, 367214, 23965, '<td valign="top">I''m going for the cat pic(k)s. Great lighting, texture, composition....with just enough color to set it off. Super job.</td>', 'I''m going for the cat pic(k)s. Great lighting, texture, composition....with just enough color to set it off. Super job.', '2006-08-01 03:27:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2682754, 368368, 23965, '<td valign="top">Pure elegance. Subtle hints of color. Barely discernable iris. Eye like a dark pool. Gorgeous silky fur, right where it belongs...on the rabbit. Super job!</td>', 'Pure elegance. Subtle hints of color. Barely discernable iris. Eye like a dark pool. Gorgeous silky fur, right where it belongs...on the rabbit. Super job!', '2006-08-01 03:40:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2682760, 369862, 23965, '<td valign="top">Ivory-hued serpent. Archetypal fearful symbol. How could I NOT comment! Dramatic composition...might like it better rotated 90 degrees clockwise. Tough not to scare your subject out of range. Good job.</td>', 'Ivory-hued serpent. Archetypal fearful symbol. How could I NOT comment! Dramatic composition...might like it better rotated 90 degrees clockwise. Tough not to scare your subject out of range. Good job.', '2006-08-01 03:46:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2682761, 367001, 16004, '<td valign="top">this is by far my favourite of the week.  it''s so interestingly done.  the mad background, the striking use and mix of soft and sharp focus, the fantastic application of black and white; it''s all very inspirng stuff.  it is so creative; i honestly can''t remember anything else looking remotely like this shot.  i would love to know your thought processes on this :)  "hmmm, black and white?  snoopy is black and white.  i know!  stick him in a book!"  absolute genius.  hope it wins.  10</td>', 'this is by far my favourite of the week.  it''s so interestingly done.  the mad background, the striking use and mix of soft and sharp focus, the fantastic application of black and white; it''s all very inspirng stuff.  it is so creative; i honestly can''t remember anything else looking remotely like this shot.  i would love to know your thought processes on this :)  "hmmm, black and white?  snoopy is black and white.  i know!  stick him in a book!"  absolute genius.  hope it wins.  10', '2006-08-01 03:46:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2682766, 368372, 23965, '<td valign="top">Luminous. One of my favorite subjects...layers of hilltops into the distance. Fog &amp; low-lying clouds inspiration for poets &amp; artists in all media.</td>', 'Luminous. One of my favorite subjects...layers of hilltops into the distance. Fog & low-lying clouds inspiration for poets & artists in all media.', '2006-08-01 03:50:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2682768, 369743, 16004, '<td valign="top">this actually looking much more striking as a thumbnail; it''s let down a little bit by the soft focus on the head of the flower (unsharp mask would have overcome this a little). the choice of background colour is superb; very unconventional i think but very effective - it''s a nicely composed set up.  sadly, it doesn''t fit into my interpretation of the challenge (i think it''s all supposed to appear to look B&amp;W). but it''s still very lovely, and certainly has that wowness i like - so an 8</td>', 'this actually looking much more striking as a thumbnail; it''s let down a little bit by the soft focus on the head of the flower (unsharp mask would have overcome this a little). the choice of background colour is superb; very unconventional i think but very effective - it''s a nicely composed set up.  sadly, it doesn''t fit into my interpretation of the challenge (i think it''s all supposed to appear to look B&W). but it''s still very lovely, and certainly has that wowness i like - so an 8', '2006-08-01 03:51:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2682771, 369804, 16004, '<td valign="top">i like the narrow crop very much, but the curvature from the lens, and also the slightly wonkiness of the keyboard lessens the impact a bit.  also, the middle keys seems to have grey splodges (might be my screen though) - needs a bit of noidr reduction.  very nice concept though.  4.</td>', 'i like the narrow crop very much, but the curvature from the lens, and also the slightly wonkiness of the keyboard lessens the impact a bit.  also, the middle keys seems to have grey splodges (might be my screen though) - needs a bit of noidr reduction.  very nice concept though.  4.', '2006-08-01 03:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2682775, 369885, 16004, '<td valign="top">very very nice.  the noise level and texture of this shot gives it an almost painted feel; also the lighting is very pleasing.  only criticism is that i kind of wished both  eyes were equally sharp and detailed; but it''s a minor quibble.  i love the close crop, the feel of the picture, and the almost smiliness of the face.  really cute too.  9.</td>', 'very very nice.  the noise level and texture of this shot gives it an almost painted feel; also the lighting is very pleasing.  only criticism is that i kind of wished both  eyes were equally sharp and detailed; but it''s a minor quibble.  i love the close crop, the feel of the picture, and the almost smiliness of the face.  really cute too.  9.', '2006-08-01 03:57:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2682781, 369338, 16004, '<td valign="top">i gave this a nine.  i love the aged look of the shoes, and how you have managed to capture and relay that so well.  it''s a seemingly simplictic set up really, but it''s also something of real beauty.  it fits the challenge and is a wonderful, wall mountable shot.</td>', 'i gave this a nine.  i love the aged look of the shoes, and how you have managed to capture and relay that so well.  it''s a seemingly simplictic set up really, but it''s also something of real beauty.  it fits the challenge and is a wonderful, wall mountable shot.', '2006-08-01 04:00:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2682855, 368393, 34238, '<td valign="top">Personally I do not believe the title of this competition has created the best photographs. Some have mocked up shots and gone to great lengths to produce a boring photo. Why didn''t they do what this photographer did? Well done, meets the challenge.</td>', 'Personally I do not believe the title of this competition has created the best photographs. Some have mocked up shots and gone to great lengths to produce a boring photo. Why didn''t they do what this photographer did? Well done, meets the challenge.', '2006-08-01 05:27:29.000000', NULL, 1),
