(2685535, 367804, 53147, '<td valign="top">Quite the funky shot. I like it alot. And being one of the people that has no rpoblem with color being in the entry I think I would have loved to have seen a bow or something of bright red in her hair. Just a small piece of red somewhere. Anyways - cool shot - hope this does well for you. Bsck to bump. Very entertaining shot.</td>', 'Quite the funky shot. I like it alot. And being one of the people that has no rpoblem with color being in the entry I think I would have loved to have seen a bow or something of bright red in her hair. Just a small piece of red somewhere. Anyways - cool shot - hope this does well for you. Bsck to bump. Very entertaining shot.', '2006-08-01 22:52:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2685539, 369838, 53147, '<td valign="top">Very nice attractive shot of a nasty plant. This works really well and I expect to see it in top ten. Well done. Back to bump - I really like this shot.</td>', 'Very nice attractive shot of a nasty plant. This works really well and I expect to see it in top ten. Well done. Back to bump - I really like this shot.', '2006-08-01 22:52:55.000000', NULL, 1),
