(2685542, 369404, 53147, '<td valign="top">So before the challenge I was trying to think of something that would be considered "greyscale" and couldnt really come up with anything. Well you have one here and its a great shot to boot. My only complaint ( a small one at that) is the left eye - either all in or all out IMO. Hope this scores well for you. Back to bump - you get one more point from me - good luck tonight!</td>', 'So before the challenge I was trying to think of something that would be considered "greyscale" and couldnt really come up with anything. Well you have one here and its a great shot to boot. My only complaint ( a small one at that) is the left eye - either all in or all out IMO. Hope this scores well for you. Back to bump - you get one more point from me - good luck tonight!', '2006-08-01 22:53:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2685543, 369338, 53147, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot. Great close up. The detail is very nice and it certainly meets the challenge. Bumping up!</td>', 'Very nice shot. Great close up. The detail is very nice and it certainly meets the challenge. Bumping up!', '2006-08-01 22:54:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2685549, 369316, 50695, '<td valign="top">the image of the image <br/>reminds us it''s an image, <br/>which reminds us <br/>that some things are real, <br/>like boys on bikes, <br/>like dirt and faded paint, <br/>like loss. <br/> <br/>You save the right half for the past,<br/>we gaze at what the boy does not see,<br/>who looks left, up and out, reminding us<br/>that he too is somebody''s past,<br/>even his own. 9</td>', 'the image of the image reminds us it''s an image, which reminds us that some things are real, like boys on bikes, like dirt and faded paint, like loss.  You save the right half for the past,we gaze at what the boy does not see,who looks left, up and out, reminding usthat he too is somebody''s past,even his own. 9', '2006-08-01 22:56:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2685551, 367001, 50695, '<td valign="top">multimedia rulz! 7</td>', 'multimedia rulz! 7', '2006-08-01 22:56:44.000000', NULL, 1),
