(2685588, 367829, 50695, '<td valign="top">great energetic demonic crazy shape. the grain just makes me feel like I''m in an old vampire movie. Halfway between Lugosi and Murnau. 8</td>', 'great energetic demonic crazy shape. the grain just makes me feel like I''m in an old vampire movie. Halfway between Lugosi and Murnau. 8', '2006-08-01 23:08:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2685589, 369228, 50695, '<td valign="top">the lines of light take this picture into another realm. It''s like a cartoon come to life, or life gone to cartoon. it is mysterious in the best possible way. 10</td>', 'the lines of light take this picture into another realm. It''s like a cartoon come to life, or life gone to cartoon. it is mysterious in the best possible way. 10', '2006-08-01 23:08:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2685590, 368110, 50695, '<td valign="top">the world is your playset. it''s only a cardboard sea. thank you for the magic that is photography. 10</td>', 'the world is your playset. it''s only a cardboard sea. thank you for the magic that is photography. 10', '2006-08-01 23:08:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2685591, 368272, 50695, '<td valign="top">great eye. this is High Modernism, or somesuch. This should be hanging on MoMA''s doorknob. 10</td>', 'great eye. this is High Modernism, or somesuch. This should be hanging on MoMA''s doorknob. 10', '2006-08-01 23:09:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2685594, 369076, 50695, '<td valign="top">beautiful. it looks like an eruption because the rock looks like it''s only a shadow. layers of beach, ocean, rock, eruption, sky, cloud all build on one another to create what is actually a serene eruption. 9</td>', 'beautiful. it looks like an eruption because the rock looks like it''s only a shadow. layers of beach, ocean, rock, eruption, sky, cloud all build on one another to create what is actually a serene eruption. 9', '2006-08-01 23:09:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2685595, 369415, 50695, '<td valign="top">I love the grain and the overexposed rectangles. 100 people are going to score you lower for this, but I am going to score you higher. Feel better? ;) the cat is wonderfully expressive, and the composition fits her perfectly into her geometry. 8</td>', 'I love the grain and the overexposed rectangles. 100 people are going to score you lower for this, but I am going to score you higher. Feel better? ;) the cat is wonderfully expressive, and the composition fits her perfectly into her geometry. 8', '2006-08-01 23:09:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2685596, 368225, 50695, '<td valign="top">cat shape + bottle shape interacting directly yet missing each other. the bottle is deliriously sharp and wet, yet the cat is dark and fuzzy with enigma. great crop and composition. a delirious curvy diagonal takes the eye from top right to bottom left. 8.</td>', 'cat shape + bottle shape interacting directly yet missing each other. the bottle is deliriously sharp and wet, yet the cat is dark and fuzzy with enigma. great crop and composition. a delirious curvy diagonal takes the eye from top right to bottom left. 8.', '2006-08-01 23:10:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2685599, 366732, 50695, '<td valign="top">ah, sweet mystery of the magic eight ball. it is as if you have captured a dream, only to leave it just beyond our reach. I love the shapes that reach up to the top of the frame and then veer away, confused. many directions going on here, to symbolize the ficklenes of the magic 8 ball. There is only one score I can give such a picture: 8</td>', 'ah, sweet mystery of the magic eight ball. it is as if you have captured a dream, only to leave it just beyond our reach. I love the shapes that reach up to the top of the frame and then veer away, confused. many directions going on here, to symbolize the ficklenes of the magic 8 ball. There is only one score I can give such a picture: 8', '2006-08-01 23:10:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2685600, 369277, 50695, '<td valign="top">a shape of rocks among other shapes of rocks becomes your subject, existing only in your eye. how did you get the bird to be in the perfect location? I love the brief white of the foam; I love the sea disappearing into fog. 8</td>', 'a shape of rocks among other shapes of rocks becomes your subject, existing only in your eye. how did you get the bird to be in the perfect location? I love the brief white of the foam; I love the sea disappearing into fog. 8', '2006-08-01 23:10:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2685601, 369133, 50695, '<td valign="top">turning the reflection upside-down works unusually well for this photo. I am transported to the world behind the mirror. 8</td>', 'turning the reflection upside-down works unusually well for this photo. I am transported to the world behind the mirror. 8', '2006-08-01 23:10:40.000000', NULL, 1),
