(2686182, 369861, 60862, '<td valign="top">This was one of only two 9s (I gave one 10).  I thought it was fantastic!<br/> <br/>And the red hair only accentuates the B&amp;W aspect;  I didn''t agree with people who thought B&amp;W should be the only two colors visible.<br/> <br/>The funny thing is I wondered, like posthumous, whether this was Judi''s entry.</td>', 'This was one of only two 9s (I gave one 10).  I thought it was fantastic! And the red hair only accentuates the B&W aspect;  I didn''t agree with people who thought B&W should be the only two colors visible. The funny thing is I wondered, like posthumous, whether this was Judi''s entry.', '2006-08-02 01:32:53.000000', NULL, 0),
