(2686901, 368260, 20056, '<td valign="top">Thanks for your comments:<br/>IMO the bird in front tell a big part of the history: mother is feeding the baby.<br/> <br/>Thinking again the picture I would have liked to crop more and only show the three heads... but the white owl is moving and when croppping, it is much noticed: I didn''t like it<br/> <br/>Regards.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-08-02 02:43:33.</i></td>', 'Thanks for your comments:IMO the bird in front tell a big part of the history: mother is feeding the baby. Thinking again the picture I would have liked to crop more and only show the three heads... but the white owl is moving and when croppping, it is much noticed: I didn''t like it Regards.', '2006-08-02 03:42:21.000000', '2006-08-02 03:43:33.000000', 0),
