(2689912, 367830, 30982, '<td valign="top">Trading Post comment<br/> <br/>I like the quietness of this.  Meets the challenge well, but I suspect the low vote is due to the lack of crisp focus on the lion''s head.  Composition seems just a bit off-balance, but in looking at it, I''m not sure what to suggest to change it.  I wouldn''t crop off the left - I like that space there, but maybe had the umbrella been angled a bit more into the bottom of the picture?  Not sure.</td>', 'Trading Post comment I like the quietness of this.  Meets the challenge well, but I suspect the low vote is due to the lack of crisp focus on the lion''s head.  Composition seems just a bit off-balance, but in looking at it, I''m not sure what to suggest to change it.  I wouldn''t crop off the left - I like that space there, but maybe had the umbrella been angled a bit more into the bottom of the picture?  Not sure.', '2006-08-02 21:31:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(2689918, 369078, 30982, '<td valign="top">Awesome shot!  I would have bet this was from Iceland, not Australia.  Love the softness of the water and the sky created by the exposure, and the bit of orange/red on the horizon is perfect - makes the shot.  Nice work!</td>', 'Awesome shot!  I would have bet this was from Iceland, not Australia.  Love the softness of the water and the sky created by the exposure, and the bit of orange/red on the horizon is perfect - makes the shot.  Nice work!', '2006-08-02 21:33:32.000000', NULL, 0),
