(2690273, 369331, 61705, '<td valign="top">I quite liked this one and would have thought it''d score well into the 6s. Oh well, 61/256 is nothing to sneeze at either :) Congrats for the fine photography all the same. Cheers.</td>', 'I quite liked this one and would have thought it''d score well into the 6s. Oh well, 61/256 is nothing to sneeze at either :) Congrats for the fine photography all the same. Cheers.', '2006-08-02 23:21:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(2690292, 369734, 61705, '<td valign="top">No way! I thought this was a brilliant piece of photography. Should have ribboned (or at the very least, finish in the top 10). Excellent effort.</td>', 'No way! I thought this was a brilliant piece of photography. Should have ribboned (or at the very least, finish in the top 10). Excellent effort.', '2006-08-02 23:25:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(2690315, 369892, 61705, '<td valign="top">I don''t think anyone else has mentioned it, but I believe this image may have been let down somewhat by the contrast inside the glass itself. It appears as though the whites are bleeding into the blacks, making it look a little murky. It is still a tremendous effort on your part and I seriously doubt I could have done it better. Cheers.</td>', 'I don''t think anyone else has mentioned it, but I believe this image may have been let down somewhat by the contrast inside the glass itself. It appears as though the whites are bleeding into the blacks, making it look a little murky. It is still a tremendous effort on your part and I seriously doubt I could have done it better. Cheers.', '2006-08-02 23:32:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(2691461, 368529, 11854, '<td valign="top">Trading post...<br/>   Well, you should have went with the cat...LOL. It''s actually a good photo, but I think subconsciously people hate pigeons. I''m surprised to see you with a sub 5 score though.</td>', 'Trading post...   Well, you should have went with the cat...LOL. It''s actually a good photo, but I think subconsciously people hate pigeons. I''m surprised to see you with a sub 5 score though.', '2006-08-03 09:45:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(2691492, 367830, 11854, '<td valign="top">Trading post...<br/>   Very interesting setup. I think the lion head is OOF in someway though. Other than more sharpening or maybe a different lighting, I don''t know what to suggest. I''ve tried a few times to work in raw, but can''t seem to get the hang of it.</td>', 'Trading post...   Very interesting setup. I think the lion head is OOF in someway though. Other than more sharpening or maybe a different lighting, I don''t know what to suggest. I''ve tried a few times to work in raw, but can''t seem to get the hang of it.', '2006-08-03 09:55:07.000000', NULL, 0),
