(3966953, 367949, 52945, '<td valign="top">Great concept. I believe this image would have scored much better with a little refinement. Some more light on the jacket would stop the suit bleeding into the background (at least it does on my monitor), maybe some back-lighting. The whites are a bit dark and could be brightened up with a levels adjustment. I do not like the yellow colour from the lamp you used, I would prefer the white balance set to remove it. I would have cloned out the two bright spots between the hands. The image is a bit too tightly cropped at the top, I would maybe leave some room for the ''head''.</td>', 'Great concept. I believe this image would have scored much better with a little refinement. Some more light on the jacket would stop the suit bleeding into the background (at least it does on my monitor), maybe some back-lighting. The whites are a bit dark and could be brightened up with a levels adjustment. I do not like the yellow colour from the lamp you used, I would prefer the white balance set to remove it. I would have cloned out the two bright spots between the hands. The image is a bit too tightly cropped at the top, I would maybe leave some room for the ''head''.', '2007-08-03 20:45:42.000000', NULL, 0),
